WEBVTT

00:00:00.990 --> 00:00:03.980
Precure! Open My Heart!

00:00:04.630 --> 00:00:07.960
A lone flower, blooming from the earth!

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:11.750
Cure Blossom!

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:14.720
Cure Marine!

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:16.280
Cure Sunshine!

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:19.900
HeartCatch Precure!

00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:25.800
You've been paying attention, haven't you?

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:28.700
You gotta make Marine look cooler than that!

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:33.840
Coffret!

00:00:35.470 --> 00:00:36.770
Rumi!

00:00:37.490 --> 00:00:39.110
Jeez, Rumi!

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:41.440
Naminami!

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:42.740
Shiku!

00:00:42.740 --> 00:00:45.020
Why's Rumi so upset?

00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:50.200
There was going to be a puppet show at her kindergarten, but they canceled it.

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:52.360
They're all really upset.

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:54.400
How disappointing.

00:00:56.420 --> 00:00:59.920
Hey, I know! Could you put on a 
puppet show with your plushies?

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:01.360
A puppet show?

00:01:01.910 --> 00:01:04.190
Well, um, I dunno if that's...

00:01:04.190 --> 00:01:06.150
Yeah, thought so.

00:01:06.150 --> 00:01:09.820
I figured they were really precious to you, but it was worth asking.

00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:11.380
Let'sh do it!

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:14.040
L-Let'sh do it!

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:14.840
Let'sh?

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:18.550
W-We'd be happy to put on a show for you!

00:01:18.550 --> 00:01:20.940
Y-You're good at that, Itsuki!

00:01:20.940 --> 00:01:25.560
W-We've always wanted to do something like this!

00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:26.730
Thank you!

00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:28.660
Yay!

00:01:28.660 --> 00:01:29.980
Yesh!

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:33.200
HeartCatch

00:01:33.190 --> 00:01:34.650
Precure!

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:38.200
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:41.200
Now, all together

00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:43.710
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:43.870 --> 00:01:46.710
Let's make our flowers bloom

00:01:51.760 --> 00:01:54.310
Within each of our chests,

00:01:54.470 --> 00:01:56.970
they begin to sprout

00:01:57.220 --> 00:01:58.640
The seeds of the heart

00:01:58.760 --> 00:01:59.890
are growing

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:02.510
bit by bit

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:03.180
Red,

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:03.800
white

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:05.100
and yellow

00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:07.850
It's because these blooming buds are

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:09.310
all varied colors

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:10.790
that they

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:12.940
shine so brightly!

00:02:13.780 --> 00:02:18.280
That smile that you've nurtured

00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:20.780
with such care

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:23.500
will never wither

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:27.080
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:29.960
Now, all together

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:32.420
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:35.090
Let's make our flowers bloom!

00:02:35.510 --> 00:02:40.010
They're always right by our sides

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:40.840
So together

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:44.680
let's make those pretty flowers of our heart

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:47.640
bloom even more!

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:49.140
HeartCatch

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:50.650
Precure!

00:02:56.060 --> 00:02:59.030
Ms. Noriko, are the puppets here yet?

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:02.660
I wanna see the puppets!

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:05.700
They'll be here soon, okay?

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:07.560
Ms. Noriko!

00:03:07.560 --> 00:03:09.200
Come play with us!

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:10.950
No!

00:03:10.950 --> 00:03:14.130
You can go play with a ball, Kouta!

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:16.130
We wanna play with her!

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:18.080
Don't pull!

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:19.640
One at a time!

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:21.420
Ms. Noriko!

00:03:21.420 --> 00:03:22.640
This is for you!

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:28.700
She fell for it!

00:03:28.700 --> 00:03:30.310
What are you kids doing?

00:03:33.930 --> 00:03:36.750
You mustn't tease Ms. Noriko like that!

00:03:38.180 --> 00:03:41.700
Honestly, you're far too lenient with these kids.

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:44.640
You need to keep them in line!

00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:48.510
Sorry, I got all caught up in the moment.

00:03:48.510 --> 00:03:49.580
Well, just keep it in mind.

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:51.750
Right...

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:59.760
The Fairies Transform?!

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:59.760
The Fairies Transform?!

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:03.150
Ms. Noriko, let's play house!

00:04:03.150 --> 00:04:05.300
But the puppet show's about to start!

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:07.900
Come on kids, sit down.

00:04:07.900 --> 00:04:10.020
The puppets aren't here yet, though!

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:13.140
We wanna play!

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:15.530
Okay, just for a bit, then.

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:20.650
Come and sit down, everyone.

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:22.450
Um...

00:04:22.730 --> 00:04:26.160
The puppets will go home if
 you don't sit down and watch.

00:04:28.220 --> 00:04:29.510
No way!

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:53.040
I'm so nervous.

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:55.060
All right, this is our moment!

00:05:00.010 --> 00:05:01.720
Oh no!

00:05:01.720 --> 00:05:03.870
S-Somebody save us!

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:10.020
Nobody will save you!

00:05:10.020 --> 00:05:15.210
I hates humans! I hates them so much!

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:22.960
Erika, you're not supposed to actually frighten them!

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:26.410
Hold it, evildoer!

00:05:26.410 --> 00:05:28.140
Stop that at once!

00:05:28.440 --> 00:05:30.590
There you are, accursed Precure!

00:05:30.590 --> 00:05:33.360
We're gonna crush you flat!

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:38.110
Get them, Precure!

00:05:38.110 --> 00:05:39.940
Don't lose to him, Precure!

00:05:40.580 --> 00:05:43.220
Stomp that Desertrian!

00:05:43.220 --> 00:05:45.150
Marine Dive!

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:47.490
Sunflower Aegish!

00:05:49.460 --> 00:05:51.690
Why don't you go and watch the show, Hiro?

00:05:51.690 --> 00:05:54.540
I don't wanna watch some dumb kids show!

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:57.500
You aren't scared of the monster, are you?

00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:59.130
O-Of course not!

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:01.510
Blossom Kick!

00:06:01.510 --> 00:06:02.590
Now you've done it!

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:05.970
Hiro actually behaved for once...

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:14.390
I'll get you for this!

00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:19.590
We'll punish the forces of evil!

00:06:28.040 --> 00:06:30.040
They really loved the show!

00:06:30.040 --> 00:06:30.870
Yeah!

00:06:50.270 --> 00:06:52.430
Feel free to dance along too.

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:53.550
Okay!

00:06:58.390 --> 00:07:00.350
They're all getting into it!

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:04.150
She's far better with these kids than I am.

00:07:04.870 --> 00:07:06.910
I can't hold a candle to her.

00:07:13.630 --> 00:07:14.990
Delicious!

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:17.610
Thanks for the food!

00:07:19.990 --> 00:07:21.680
This is really nice!

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:22.580
Yeah!

00:07:26.310 --> 00:07:28.050
Are you okay, Rumi?

00:07:28.740 --> 00:07:30.040
Thank you.

00:07:30.730 --> 00:07:32.430
Ms. Noriko!

00:07:32.870 --> 00:07:34.140
I dropped my spoon!

00:07:34.770 --> 00:07:36.680
Give me a second!

00:07:39.870 --> 00:07:42.210
Ms. Noriko!

00:07:43.060 --> 00:07:44.110
What is it?

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:50.030
You don't get much of a chance to eat your lunch, do you?

00:07:50.340 --> 00:07:52.110
I'm used to it by now.

00:07:52.110 --> 00:07:55.620
The kids always have me rushing around for them.

00:07:55.620 --> 00:08:00.250
I know I should be able to keep them in check like she can, and yet...

00:08:02.300 --> 00:08:03.890
Ms. Noriko!

00:08:03.890 --> 00:08:05.920
Can you peel my orange for me?

00:08:06.580 --> 00:08:08.130
Of course I can, Haruka!

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:10.630
I'm the Orange Monster!

00:08:10.630 --> 00:08:13.370
Come on, don't play with your food.

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:19.640
Orange, orange!

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:21.350
I wanna play too!

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:23.960
Kouta, please!

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:25.010
You think you can beat the Orange Monster?!

00:08:25.010 --> 00:08:27.060
Yeah! Cause I'm Orange Superman W!{note 4 herkz-chon/commie devs: this is a reference to Kamen Rider W, the show that aired right before HeartCatch. it's pronounced 'double' but written as 'W' so if you wanna annoy tokusatsu nerds like me then change it i guess}

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:30.280
If I beat you, I'll be the Orange King!

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:31.500
What?!

00:08:31.500 --> 00:08:33.200
What about my orange?

00:08:31.500 --> 00:08:33.200
It's on!

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:35.480
Take this! Orange Punch!

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:40.540
<i>I need to keep them in check.</i>

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:44.500
<i>I have to stop them from misbehaving.</i>

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:47.670
<i>I have to...</i>

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:52.010
S-Stop it!

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:55.110
Sit down and... eatyourlunch...

00:08:56.500 --> 00:08:58.210
Ms. Noriko?

00:08:59.590 --> 00:09:01.360
What are you doing?

00:09:02.340 --> 00:09:04.890
Just sit down and eat!

00:09:09.580 --> 00:09:12.730
You're acting really weird today, Ms. Noriko.

00:09:24.390 --> 00:09:26.870
Losing Sasorina was unexpected.

00:09:27.220 --> 00:09:30.340
She fought hard, until her last breath.

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:35.060
But the HeartCatch Mirage's power is truly remarkable.

00:09:35.060 --> 00:09:38.090
King Dune shall soon arrive on Earth.

00:09:38.090 --> 00:09:43.020
It is imperative that we destroy the Precure before he arrives.

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:43.840
Sir!

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:45.810
Kumojacky?

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:50.060
I'm going to avenge Sasorina's death.

00:09:50.060 --> 00:09:54.400
I'll smash their HeartCatch Mirage into pieces!

00:10:24.420 --> 00:10:26.770
Just sit down and eat!

00:10:26.770 --> 00:10:30.160
You're acting really weird today, Ms. Noriko.

00:10:33.250 --> 00:10:35.480
How very convenient.

00:10:35.480 --> 00:10:37.360
Wh-Who are you?

00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:41.570
I am Kumojacky, a commander of the Desert Apostles.

00:10:42.460 --> 00:10:47.100
I will use the weakened Flower of your Heart to draw out those Precure!

00:10:48.060 --> 00:10:51.500
Flower of the Heart, show yourself!

00:10:59.890 --> 00:11:03.590
You're up, Desertrian!

00:11:11.720 --> 00:11:13.170
A Desertrian?!

00:11:13.170 --> 00:11:16.690
Ms. Noriko's Flower of the Heart is the one that was stolen!

00:11:17.060 --> 00:11:18.830
We need to transform!

00:11:18.830 --> 00:11:21.590
Leave the children to me.

00:11:21.590 --> 00:11:22.740
Thanks!

00:11:31.420 --> 00:11:35.040
Go forth, Seeds of the Precure!

00:11:37.690 --> 00:11:38.860
Precure!

00:11:38.860 --> 00:11:40.670
Open My Heart!

00:12:27.180 --> 00:12:30.220
A lone flower, blooming from the earth!

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:35.330
Cure Blossom!

00:12:38.060 --> 00:12:40.960
A lone flower, swaying in the sea breeze!

00:12:43.890 --> 00:12:45.360
Cure Marine!

00:12:48.120 --> 00:12:51.200
A lone flower, bathing in the Sun's rays!

00:12:53.420 --> 00:12:54.920
Cure Sunshine!

00:12:58.340 --> 00:13:01.780
HeartCatch Precure!

00:13:04.370 --> 00:13:05.760
There you are.

00:13:06.240 --> 00:13:09.110
You really do seem to have gotten stronger.

00:13:09.110 --> 00:13:12.440
But know this! I'm far stronger than Sasorina was.

00:13:12.440 --> 00:13:14.890
It's time you runts learned that for yourselves!

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:16.300
Blossom!

00:13:16.300 --> 00:13:17.150
Right!

00:13:37.910 --> 00:13:38.910
What's going on?

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:49.140
Help us, Ms. Noriko!

00:13:49.140 --> 00:13:51.010
Ms. Noriko!

00:13:51.730 --> 00:13:54.000
I love those kids so much.

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:57.140
But I need to make them listen to what I say!

00:13:57.140 --> 00:13:59.890
I can't keep spoiling them like this!

00:13:59.890 --> 00:14:03.040
How can I be firm with them like she is?!

00:14:03.040 --> 00:14:07.370
How can I be a proper influence on those kids?!

00:14:07.370 --> 00:14:09.620
See for yourself, Desertrian!

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:16.910
Where are you, Ms. Noriko?!

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:19.630
I'm scared, Ms. Noriko!

00:14:19.630 --> 00:14:21.840
Ms. Noriko!

00:14:22.160 --> 00:14:23.800
Do you hear that?

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:27.200
The first person they call for when they awaken

00:14:27.200 --> 00:14:30.090
is their beloved Ms. Noriko!

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:32.140
You! You, and nobody else!

00:14:32.610 --> 00:14:35.870
And yet you want to change, to be someone else?!

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:40.060
Tch! Get them already, Desertrian!

00:14:47.180 --> 00:14:51.730
You dumb monster! Where have you taken Ms. Noriko?!

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:03.500
Give back Ms. Noriko!

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:06.050
Where are you, Ms. Noriko?!

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:10.470
Get lost, monster!

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:14.220
Believe in the children!

00:15:14.580 --> 00:15:17.430
They all love you the way you are!

00:15:17.740 --> 00:15:19.310
Ms. Noriko!

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:21.270
Ms. Noriko!

00:15:25.240 --> 00:15:30.700
Give back Ms. Noriko!

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:40.790
What a pathetic Desertrian!

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:46.860
Sink into the darkness, and let your dark heart control you!

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:50.360
Dark Bracelet!

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:02.180
We can't fight him here!

00:16:02.180 --> 00:16:03.920
Let's get him away from the kids!

00:16:03.920 --> 00:16:04.500
Right!

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:09.440
You're not getting away!

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:31.010
Those weak attacks won't even scratch me!

00:16:34.190 --> 00:16:35.090
Are you okay?

00:16:56.020 --> 00:16:57.370
Moonlight!

00:16:57.370 --> 00:16:58.740
Apologies for the delay.

00:16:59.070 --> 00:17:03.670
I take it you noticed how defenseless he is when shooting those wind blasts from his mouth?

00:17:03.670 --> 00:17:05.560
That's when we strike.

00:17:05.560 --> 00:17:06.580
Okay!

00:17:12.590 --> 00:17:15.720
You want to get blown away that badly?!

00:17:21.120 --> 00:17:22.930
Sunflower Aegis!

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:27.030
Blossom Shoot!

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:31.900
Marine Dive!

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:44.330
Now!

00:17:51.460 --> 00:17:55.190
Mirror, o mirror, grant we Precure your power!

00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:25.580
The shining flowers illuminating the world.

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:31.450
HeartCatch Precure: Super Silhouettes!

00:18:36.950 --> 00:18:39.160
Flowers, bloom tall!

00:18:43.620 --> 00:18:47.630
Precure HeartCatch Orchestra!

00:19:16.790 --> 00:19:17.990
Retreat!

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:30.100
Let's restore the Flower of her Heart!

00:19:35.700 --> 00:19:36.750
Ms. Noriko?

00:19:44.760 --> 00:19:45.990
What have I...

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:50.490
Are you okay, Ms. Noriko?

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:54.920
Ms. Noriko, do you need to rest?

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:57.840
Does it hurt anywhere, Ms. Noriko?

00:19:58.140 --> 00:19:59.150
I'm sorry...

00:20:00.140 --> 00:20:02.150
for worrying you all.

00:20:06.590 --> 00:20:08.430
Come closer, Hiro.

00:20:12.080 --> 00:20:14.100
This is for you.

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:30.200
Jeez, you scared me!

00:20:31.450 --> 00:20:32.690
Ms. Noriko...

00:20:33.660 --> 00:20:34.940
I'm sorry.

00:20:45.550 --> 00:20:47.100
Come on, join us!

00:20:49.100 --> 00:20:50.430
Yeah!

00:20:51.310 --> 00:20:53.830
<i>Thank you, everyone.</i>

00:20:54.860 --> 00:20:57.730
<i>I love you all so much!</i>

00:20:58.490 --> 00:21:01.700
In the language of flowers,
 a safflower means "tolerance."

00:21:01.700 --> 00:21:04.320
She extends her kindness to the children around her.

00:21:04.770 --> 00:21:08.330
She finally remembered the talent she truly has.

00:21:08.620 --> 00:21:14.870
I'm sure they'll grow to love her even more now!

00:21:18.330 --> 00:21:21.210
I think a Heart Seed's about to be born.

00:21:31.310 --> 00:21:35.870
With this, the Great Heart Tree has recovered a little more!

00:21:42.920 --> 00:21:46.670
Kumojacky was no match for the Mirage either.

00:21:48.700 --> 00:21:50.930
It seems your power...

00:21:50.930 --> 00:21:52.990
no, you yourself will be required,

00:21:52.990 --> 00:21:54.230
Dark.

00:21:57.980 --> 00:21:59.600
It won't be long now.

00:22:12.260 --> 00:22:17.940
So come on, let's sing together in harmony!

00:22:19.600 --> 00:22:22.140
Come on, all together now!

00:22:22.940 --> 00:22:25.650
HeartCatch Precure!

00:22:27.030 --> 00:22:32.570
When you give life your all, within your heart

00:22:34.150 --> 00:22:38.160
a shining flower begins to bloom

00:22:40.160 --> 00:22:47.130
So when you feel like crying, raise your head

00:22:48.790 --> 00:22:53.840
and you'll see everyone's there by your side!

00:22:54.720 --> 00:22:59.930
So let's dance together, hand in hand!

00:23:02.600 --> 00:23:04.310
All those

00:23:04.470 --> 00:23:08.890
happy feelings will be shared amongst us!

00:23:09.230 --> 00:23:14.150
Lose yourself is the melody!

00:23:14.150 --> 00:23:16.820
Yay, yay, hey!

00:23:17.370 --> 00:23:21.040
And tomorrow will bring even more Hallelujahs!

00:23:21.240 --> 00:23:27.170
So come on! Let's make the Flowers of our Hearts bloom!

00:23:28.790 --> 00:23:31.250
With all our might!

00:23:31.930 --> 00:23:34.550
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:35.550 --> 00:23:37.720
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:42.810 --> 00:23:44.980
<i>Could this letter adorned with a heart be...</i>

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:46.270
<i>It's a love letter!</i>

00:23:46.560 --> 00:23:47.650
<i>I've never seen one before!</i>

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:50.780
<i>So a guy finally took note of my good points, huh?</i>

00:23:50.780 --> 00:23:53.000
<i>No, this is clearly addressed to me!</i>

00:23:53.000 --> 00:23:56.030
